	"VersionName": "0.1",
	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Experience",
	"Description": "Experiences for the mode framework (M12 G0/G1, decision D5): UGSTN_ExperienceDefinition (Game Features to enable, default pawn data, action sets, mode tag), UGSTN_PawnData, UGSTN_ExperienceActionSet and the GameState component that loads them in a fixed order (Loading, LoadingGameFeatures, ExecutingActions, Loaded) on the host and on clients. Includes the guard that keeps Network Prediction pawns from simulating before the Experience is Loaded. Pure engine dependencies: no GAS, Network Prediction or Mover, so it works without the GAS-NPP fork.",
	"Category": "Gameplay",
